msgstr "Ukončiť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vsync"
msgstr "Vsync"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "Celá obrazovka"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "FPS counter"
msgstr "Počítadlo FPS"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "On-screen notifications"
msgstr "Oznámenia na obrazovke"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light-gun mode"
msgstr "Režim svetelnej pištole"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Obraz"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wait for vertical blank before presenting.\n"
"Prevents tearing but adds up to one frame of latency."
msgstr ""
"Pred zobrazením čaká na vertikálne zatemnenie.\n"
"Zabraňuje trhaniu obrazu, ale pridá až jednu snímku oneskorenia."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Oznámenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "Automaticky (systém)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Jazyk"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "Auto (najlepší)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Renderer"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Softvérový"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Ktorý renderer vykresľuje hru. Prejaví sa pri ďalšom\n"
"spustení - uložte nastavenia a spustite znova."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Veľkosť okna"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Šírka"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Výška"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (natívne)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "Mierka 3D vykresľovania"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Vnútorné rozlíšenie 3D vykresľovania. Vyššie dáva ostrejšie\n"
"3D (2D/HUD zostáva ostré). Len GPU renderery; softvérový\n"
"renderer zostáva natívny. Prejaví sa pri ďalšom spustení\n"
"- uložte nastavenia a spustite znova."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilineárne"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celočíselné"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Najbližší"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Ostré bilineárne"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "Škálovanie 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Ako sa snímka zväčšuje do okna. Ostré bilineárne drží\n"
"2D text ostrý bez mihotania, ktoré má najbližší pri\n"
"neceločíselnej veľkosti okna. Celočíselné prichytí\n"
"k celému násobku (presne na pixel, s čiernymi pruhmi).\n"
"Prejaví sa hneď."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (automat)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Štvorcové pixely"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Roztiahnuť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Pomer strán"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 je tvar monitora automatu (predvolené).\n"
"Štvorcové pixely ukážu surových 496x384 (trochu úzke).\n"
"Roztiahnuť vyplní celé okno. Prejaví sa hneď."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "Filter CRT"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Kozmetický vzhľad monitora automatu cez hotovú snímku:\n"
"riadkovanie, RGB maska, žiara a voliteľné zakrivenie\n"
"obrazovky. Čisto vizuálne; prejaví sa hneď."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Riadkovanie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Maska"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Žiara"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Zakrivenie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Vylepšenia (kozmetické, nad rámec pôvodného hardvéru)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anizotropné"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Verné"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "Filter 3D textúr"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(nepodporované)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "Toto GPU nehlási anizotropné filtrovanie."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anizotropia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "Zväčšenie 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Vyhladzuje hrany 2D vrstiev (HUD, text, ponuky). xBR a\n"
"ScaleFX zaobľujú uhlopriečky; Verné drží ostré pixely.\n"
"Prejaví sa hneď."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Prelínané"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Šachovnica"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Priehľadnosť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Hardvér kreslí priehľadné plochy (svetlá, sklo, tiene)\n"
"ako šachovnicu. Prelínané kreslí 50% priehľadnú\n"
"plochu, o ktorú sa snaží. Prejaví sa hneď."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Vlastné textúry"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Nahradí 3D textúry hry obrázkami uloženými v\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, pomenovanými ako pri výpise.\n"
"Len GPU renderery; Znova načítať prevezme upravené súbory."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "Načítané: %zu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Znova načítať"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Vypísať textúry"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Zbiera každú 3D textúru, ktorú hra kreslí, a zapíše ich\n"
"s index.html na prehliadanie do saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"po ukončení hry alebo vypnutí tejto voľby."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Zvuk"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "Cesty"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Prehľadávať..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "Priečinok konfigurácie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where sm2-emu.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"Odkiaľ sa sm2-emu.ini načítava a kam sa ukladá.\n"
"Nastavuje sa cez --config <dir>; tu sa nedá zmeniť."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "Priečinok ROM"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"Kde sú archívy ROM. Hra spustená podľa názvu sa\n"
"načíta odtiaľto ako <name>.zip alebo <name>.7z."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "Priečinok uložení"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"Batériovo zálohované dáta: obrazy NVRAM (.nv) a EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) pre každú hru -- rekordy a nastavenia operátora."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "Priečinok snímok obrazovky"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
msgstr "Kam sa ukladajú snímky obrazovky z F12."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "Sťahovať obrázky online"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps sm2-emu offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Umožní výberu hier sťahovať obaly a popisy z\n"
"ArcadeDB cez sieť. Vypnuté drží sm2-emu offline:\n"
"výber stále zobrazí a spustí každú hru, so\n"
"zástupnými dlaždicami a bez popisov."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Gamepad"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel"
msgstr "Volant"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light Gun"
msgstr "Pištoľ"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Sieť"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "States"
msgstr "Stavy"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "About"
msgstr "O programe"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Sega Model 2 arcade emulator"
msgstr "Emulátor arkádových automatov Sega Model 2"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "BSD 3-Clause licence. See LICENSE."
msgstr "Licencia BSD 3-Clause. Pozri LICENSE."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "sm2-emu exists because of open source shared with the community."
msgstr "sm2-emu existuje vďaka otvorenému kódu zdieľanému s komunitou."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "With thanks to the projects whose code makes it possible:"
msgstr "Vďaka projektom, ktorých kód to umožňuje:"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "The MAME project - Sega Model 2 emulation guidance"
msgstr "Projekt MAME - usmernenie pre emuláciu Sega Model 2"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Musashi - Motorola 68000 CPU core (Karl Stenerud)"
msgstr "Musashi - jadro CPU Motorola 68000 (Karl Stenerud)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ymfm - Yamaha FM sound cores (Aaron Giles)"
msgstr "ymfm - zvukové FM jadrá Yamaha (Aaron Giles)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "SDL - windowing, input and audio"
msgstr "SDL - okná, vstup a zvuk"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dear ImGui - this user interface (Omar Cornut)"
msgstr "Dear ImGui - toto používateľské rozhranie (Omar Cornut)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "pugixml - games.xml parsing"
msgstr "pugixml - spracovanie games.xml"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "miniz - ZIP archive decompression"
msgstr "miniz - rozbaľovanie archívov ZIP"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "LZMA SDK - 7-Zip archive decompression (Igor Pavlov)"
msgstr "LZMA SDK - rozbaľovanie archívov 7-Zip (Igor Pavlov)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "VulkanMemoryAllocator - GPU memory (AMD / GPUOpen)"
msgstr "VulkanMemoryAllocator - pamäť GPU (AMD / GPUOpen)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "shaderc / glslang - shader compilation"
msgstr "shaderc / glslang - kompilácia shaderov"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "stb_image - box-art image decoding (Sean Barrett)"
msgstr "stb_image - dekódovanie obrázkov obalov (Sean Barrett)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad picture - Xelu's Free Controller Prompts (Nicolae Berbece), CC0"
msgstr "Obrázok gamepadu - Xelu's Free Controller Prompts (Nicolae Berbece), CC0"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "libcurl - artwork scraping (optional)"
msgstr "libcurl - sťahovanie obrázkov (voliteľné)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "HarfBuzz - text shaping for translations"
msgstr "HarfBuzz - tvarovanie textu pre preklady"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "SheenBidi - right-to-left text layout (Muhammad Tayyab Akram)"
msgstr "SheenBidi - sadzba textu sprava doľava (Muhammad Tayyab Akram)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game artwork and descriptions from ArcadeDB"
msgstr "Obrázky a popisy hier z ArcadeDB"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(adb.arcadeitalia.net, by Motoschifo)."
msgstr "(adb.arcadeitalia.net, autor Motoschifo)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "See NOTICE for full per-component attribution."
msgstr "Úplné uvedenie autorov komponentov nájdete v NOTICE."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you'd like to support development:"
msgstr "Ak chcete podporiť vývoj:"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Uložiť nastavenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Saved to %s"
msgstr "Uložené do %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel connected."
msgstr "Volant pripojený."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "No wheel connected. Settings still apply once one is."
msgstr "Nie je pripojený žiadny volant. Nastavenia platia, keď bude."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "Force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"Sila volantu v pretekárskych hrách: centrovacie a zákrutové\n"
"sily dekódované z príkazov pre drive board hry,\n"
"plus náraz, keď do niečoho narazíte."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "Odpor"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "Obrátiť force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"Pre volant, ktorého ovládač tlačí zlým smerom: ťahá\n"
"od stredu namiesto návratu doň a sily hry\n"
"pôsobia opačne."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "Vibrácie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Vibruje pri nárazoch v hre, pre volanty bez force\n"
"feedback. Nikdy nebeží súčasne s force feedback."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "Sila vibrácií"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "Vibrácie motora"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Pridané vibrácie, ktoré rastú s plynom. Nepochádzajú\n"
"z hry. Vypnite, ak chcete cítiť len force feedback hry."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u st."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "Rozsah riadenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"Nastavte na rozsah otáčania svojho volantu. Uhol\n"
"natočenia nižšie sa naň mapuje, takže zhoda s volantom\n"
"dáva odozvu ako na automate."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lock angle"
msgstr "Uhol natočenia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%d deg"
msgstr "%d st."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How far to physically turn for full game lock (total,\n"
"so half each side of centre). Lower is more sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Ako ďaleko fyzicky otočiť pre plné natočenie v hre\n"
"(spolu, teda polovica na každú stranu). Menej = citlivejšie."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axes"
msgstr "Osi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-detected. Recalibrate if steering or a pedal is wrong."
msgstr "Zistené automaticky. Prekalibrujte, ak riadenie alebo pedál nefunguje správne."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering"
msgstr "Riadenie"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accelerator"
msgstr "Plyn"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brake"
